WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.627 --> 00:00:03.795
Carlos: Life can change
in a fraction of a second.

00:00:07.841 --> 00:00:10.844
Greg: Carlos Ghosn was the best
automotive CEO in the world.

00:00:12.221 --> 00:00:13.972
Nick: One of the most
respected business executives

00:00:14.056 --> 00:00:15.140
ahead of Bill Gates.

00:00:15.224 --> 00:00:17.267
We have reached a new era.

00:00:17.351 --> 00:00:19.811
Crowd: Nissan! Nissan!

00:00:21.522 --> 00:00:22.981
Nick: It's kind of
the story of Icarus.

00:00:23.440 --> 00:00:25.567
The guy soared
to the highest of highs.

00:00:26.109 --> 00:00:27.069
Probably too high.

00:00:30.030 --> 00:00:31.323
News: Breaking news…

00:00:31.406 --> 00:00:34.034
Carlos Ghosn has been arrested
in Japan.

00:00:34.117 --> 00:00:36.119
Hiroto: There were many
serious wrongdoings.

00:00:36.954 --> 00:00:38.539
News: Money laundering
and corruption.

00:00:38.622 --> 00:00:42.000
News: Ghosn faces a maximum
penalty of 10 years imprisonment.

00:00:44.169 --> 00:00:47.047
News: Is Carlos Ghosn a victim?
Or a villain?

00:00:48.799 --> 00:00:53.303
♪

00:00:54.096 --> 00:00:55.180
Now I'm gonna surprise you.

00:00:58.934 --> 00:01:00.978
♪

00:01:01.061 --> 00:01:02.354
Nick: There was
tons of evidence.

00:01:02.437 --> 00:01:04.690
This hard drive is the key
to the entire Ghosn story.

00:01:06.191 --> 00:01:07.860
Robert: He called
a former Green Beret.

00:01:08.694 --> 00:01:10.737
The plan was
to put him in a box

00:01:10.821 --> 00:01:12.364
and drill holes
so he could breathe.

00:01:15.075 --> 00:01:18.203
Carole: This story is much
bigger than we think it is.

00:01:20.581 --> 00:01:22.082
Nick: We only knew
one side of Carlos Ghosn.

00:01:23.917 --> 00:01:24.793
Michael: He gets caught…

00:01:26.336 --> 00:01:27.337
he loses his life.

00:01:29.548 --> 00:01:30.799
Richard: Why did you do it?

00:01:30.883 --> 00:01:33.635
There was no turning back.
They tried to destroy me.

00:01:33.719 --> 00:01:38.098
♪

00:01:38.891 --> 00:01:41.727
Michael: Life's got a lot
of strange twists and turns.

